&lt;img alt="0102010_011.png" src="images/0102010_011.png" style="height: 655.84px; width: 637.13px"/&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="style_pb_after" style="line-height: 1; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
